---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
import {content} from '../data/content';
const aboutContent=content.about ?? {};
const ownerImage=aboutContent.imageUrl || (aboutContent.mediaId ? '/media/'+aboutContent.mediaId+'.webp' : '/images/studio-wall-logo.png');
---
<Layout title="About the studio" description="Meet Sandhya Verma, celebrity makeup artist and salon owner in Janakpuri, West Delhi.">
<PageHeading eyebrow="THE STUDIO / OUR STORY" title="Celebrity artistry." accent="Personal attention." text="Sandhya Verma Makeovers brings camera-ready beauty, occasion glamour and a considered one-to-one approach to every booking." />
<section class="section-wrap split-section"><div class="framed-photo studio-logo-photo"><img src={ownerImage} width="800" height="1000" alt="Sandhya Verma, celebrity makeup artist and salon owner" /><small>Sandhya Verma · Celebrity Makeup Artist · Janakpuri, New Delhi.</small></div><div><span class="eyebrow">MEET THE OWNER</span><h2>Beauty that feels<br /><em>like your own.</em></h2><p>Sandhya Verma is a celebrity makeup artist and salon owner based in Janakpuri, West Delhi. Her work moves between bridal moments, celebrations, editorial beauty and camera-ready glamour.</p><p>Whether you are preparing for an important occasion or discovering the art of makeup, every conversation starts with your vision, your comfort and the finish you want to wear.</p><p class="editorial-note">See the studio’s latest published work on the official Instagram profile.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="https://www.instagram.com/sandhyavermamakeovers/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Follow on Instagram ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="section-wrap section-space"><div class="principle-grid"><article><span class="eyebrow">01 / LISTEN</span><h3>Your vision comes first.</h3><p>Bring your ideas, your references and your questions. We’ll discuss what fits your occasion.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">02 / CREATE</span><h3>Beauty in the details.</h3><p>Skin, colour, texture and finish come together around the look you want to create.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">03 / LEARN</span><h3>Pass the artistry on.</h3><p>Explore the academy and ask about the right learning path for your interests.</p></article></div></section>
</Layout>
